# @Push_Art Gallery — environment template
# Copy to `.env` for local Vite overrides only. Never commit `.env`.
#
# Gallery images + audio are NOT configured here.
# They come from a private assets repo (local copy or CI via Actions secrets):
#   ASSETS_REPO  / ASSETS_TOKEN  → GitHub repo Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
#
# Never put ASSETS_TOKEN (or any PAT) in this file or any PUBLIC_* variable —
# those would be exposed to the browser.

# Example (unused today):
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.github.io/My-Art-Gallery/
